    [BugFix] Revert PCP-local profile token budget (#18270) (#19243)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Revert #18270 (commit `9baf957e8fda95e85be70e101e0beea2c207d712`).
    Remove the PCP-local temporary token budget from MRV2 profile_run and
    restore the previous profile behavior.
    
    Only `vllm_ascend/worker/v2/model_runner.py` and
    `tests/ut/worker/test_model_runner_v2.py` are changed. Later unrelated
    API/fixture changes are retained. No MoE prepare/finalize, platform,
    forward-context or runtime MTP changes are introduced.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    Restores the profiling behavior preceding #18270. No new configuration
    or environment variables.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    Not run, as explicitly requested. This is a revert of the original
    two-file change; no new validation results are claimed.
    
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/a98247ab4db686ee03c66d5feb3c761e52a2f8ab
    
    Signed-off-by: chengruiqi (C) <c00913489@china.huawei.com>
    Co-authored-by: chengruiqi (C) <c00913489@china.huawei.com>

